  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>쉬<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ehl-pc0syCU?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>號<rt>호-</rt></ruby><ruby>做<rt>조ˋ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>샹<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby> <ruby>講<rt>겅ˋ</rt></ruby>’<ruby>ᄅᆤ<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>道理<rt>도리ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sûi-sûi-sûi-sûi-sùi, siâ̰-mîh ho-jò-sùi, siáng kòng’liàu u-to-lì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>哪<rt>나ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>遮邇<rt>쟣ˆ니</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>尻川<rt>카ˉ층ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>黏<rt>럄-</rt></ruby><ruby>大腿<rt>돠튀ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sûi-sûi-sûi-sûi-sùi, nà e-jiâh-ni-sùi, khā-chn̂g liam-toa-thùi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>䆀<rt>빼ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>得<rt>뎩ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>比<rt>비ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>愛<rt>애ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>家己<rt>가ˉ기ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>上<rt>셩-</rt></ruby><ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>氣<rt>키</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sûi-sûi-sûi-sùi, sûi-bài bo-tiêk-pì, ài-tioh-kā-kī siong-sûi-khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>哪<rt>나ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>遮邇<rt>쟣ˆ니</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>呵咾<rt>오ˉ로ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>徦<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>觸舌<rt>닥ˆ짛ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sûi-sûi-sûi-sûi-sùi, nà e-jiâh-ni-sùi, ō-lô-kâh-e-tâk-jîh\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>厝邊頭尾<rt>추ˋ빌ˉᄐᅷ쀄ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>古錐<rt>거ˆ쥐ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chù-pḭ̄-thau-buè kông-goà kôr-jûi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꾼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>阿母<rt>아ˉ뿌ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>可能<rt>코ˆ롕-</rt></ruby><ruby>傷過<rt>슐ˉ궤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>謙虛<rt>걈ˉ희ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gûn-ā-bù khô-lieng-siṵ̄-kuè-kiām-hî\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>이<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>講<rt>겅ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> &#8220;<ruby>無<rt>뽀ˊ</rt></ruby>’랗 <ruby>哪<rt>나ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有<rt>우ˉ</rt></ruby>&#8221;\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ī kòng, “bó’lah nà ū”\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꾼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>兜<rt>ᄃᅷˆ</rt></ruby> 제<ruby>細<rt>쇠ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>粒<rt>럅-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>子<rt>즤ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>胸坎<rt>혱ˉ캄ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>物<rt>밓ˆ</rt></ruby>’랗, <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>物<rt>밓ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gûn-tâu je-soè-liap-jì, hiēng-khàm bo-mîh’lah, bo-mîh\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>號<rt>호-</rt></ruby><ruby>做<rt>조ˋ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>샹<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby> <ruby>講<rt>겅ˋ</rt></ruby>’<ruby>ᄅᆤ<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>道理<rt>도리ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siâ̰-mîh ho-jò-sùi, siáng kòng’liàu u-to-lì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>䆀<rt>빼ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>得<rt>뎩ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>比<rt>비ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>比<rt>비ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>到<rt>ᄀᅷˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>民國<rt>삔걱</rt></ruby> <ruby>幾<rt>귀ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>年<rt>니ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sûi-bài bo-tiêk-pì, si-bêh-pî-kàu-bin-kork kûi-ní\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>肨奶<rt>항ˋ롕ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>奶<rt>롕ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>佮意<rt>갛ˆ이</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hàng-liêng, bo-liêng, lông-u-láng kâh-i\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꾼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>朋友<rt>볭유ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>身懸<rt>신ˉ괘ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>百<rt>밯ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>七<rt>칟</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><a class=\"gloss-link gloss-link-nowrap\" href=\"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/mini#English\" title=\"(en) mini\"><ruby>미<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>니<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby></a><ruby>品<rt>핀ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gûn-pieng-yù sīn-koái pâh-chit, goà si-mī-nī-phìn\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>號<rt>호-</rt></ruby><ruby>做<rt>조ˋ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>샹<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby> <ruby>講<rt>겅ˋ</rt></ruby>’<ruby>ᄅᆤ<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>道理<rt>도리ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sûi-sûi-sûi-sûi-sùi, siâ̰-mîh ho-jò-sùi, siáng kòng’liàu u-to-lì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>哪<rt>나ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>遮邇<rt>쟣ˆ니</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>尻川<rt>카ˉ층ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>黏<rt>럄-</rt></ruby><ruby>大腿<rt>돠튀ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sûi-sûi-sûi-sûi-sùi, nà e-jiâh-ni-sùi, khā-chn̂g liam-toa-thùi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line lyric-muted\">\n    (&#8220;<ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby>가<ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>消遣<rt>ᄉᆤˉ켼ˋ</rt></ruby>’엏?&#8221;)\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    (“lì lêh-ka-goà siāu-khièn’orh?”)\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>䆀<rt>빼ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>得<rt>뎩ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>比<rt>비ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>愛<rt>애ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>家己<rt>가ˉ기ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>上<rt>셩-</rt></ruby><ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>氣<rt>키</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sûi-sûi-sûi-sùi, sûi-bài bo-tiêk-pì, ài-tioh-kā-kī siong-sûi-khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>哪<rt>나ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>遮邇<rt>쟣ˆ니</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>呵咾<rt>오ˉ로ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>徦<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>觸舌<rt>닥ˆ짛ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sûi-sûi-sûi-sûi-sùi, nà e-jiâh-ni-sùi, ō-lô-kâh-e-tâk-jîh\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>閉思<rt>비ˋ수</rt></ruby> <ruby>抑是<rt>앟시</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>主見<rt>주ˆ곈</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>丈夫<rt>다ˉ버ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>抑是<rt>앟시</rt></ruby><ruby>㜁𡚸<rt>자ˉ뻐ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>體<rt>테ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    pì-su ah-si-u-jû-kien, tā-pôr ah-si-jā-bôr-thè\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>天然<rt>톈ˉ뗸ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>抑是<rt>앟시</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>시<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>아<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>껳<a href=\"#_ftn1\" id=\"_ftnref1\"><strong>¹</strong></a>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    thiēn-rién’e ah-si-u-sī-â-geh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>제<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>模樣<rt>뻐율ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>身體<rt>신ˉ테ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jè si-goà’e bor-yṵ̄ goà’e sīn-thè\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>會當<rt>에당ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>活<rt>왛-</rt></ruby><ruby>出<rt>춛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>世間<rt>세ˋ간ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>捌<rt>빧ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>看<rt>콸</rt></ruby>’궤에\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    e-tàng-oah-chût-sè-kân m-bât-khoa̰’kue-e\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>號<rt>호-</rt></ruby><ruby>做<rt>조ˋ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>샹<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby> <ruby>講<rt>겅ˋ</rt></ruby>’<ruby>ᄅᆤ<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>道理<rt>도리ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sûi-sûi-sûi-sûi-sùi, siâ̰-mîh ho-jò-sùi, siáng kòng’liàu u-to-lì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>哪<rt>나ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>遮邇<rt>쟣ˆ니</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>尻川<rt>카ˉ층ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>黏<rt>럄-</rt></ruby><ruby>大腿<rt>돠튀ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sûi-sûi-sûi-sûi-sùi, nà e-jiâh-ni-sùi, khā-chn̂g liam-toa-thùi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>䆀<rt>빼ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>得<rt>뎩ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>比<rt>비ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>愛<rt>애ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>家己<rt>가ˉ기ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>上<rt>셩-</rt></ruby><ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>氣<rt>키</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sûi-sûi-sûi-sùi, sûi-bài bo-tiêk-pì, ài-tioh-kā-kī siong-sûi-khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>水<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>哪<rt>나ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>遮邇<rt>쟣ˆ니</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>呵咾<rt>오ˉ로ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>徦<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>觸舌<rt>닥ˆ짛ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sûi-sûi-sûi-sûi-sùi, nà e-jiâh-ni-sùi, ō-lô-kâh-e-tâk-jîh\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line lyric-muted\">\n    (&#8220;<ruby>애<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>요<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꾼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>제<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’헣, <ruby>꾼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>제<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>生<rt>셀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>緣<rt>옌ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>較<rt>캏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>好<rt>호ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>生<rt>셀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>’랗&#8221;)\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    (“āi-yō gûn-jè’horh, gûn-jè sḛ̄-yén khâh-hò lêh-sḛ̄-sùi’lah”)\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line lyric-muted\">\n    (&#8220;<ruby>今仔<rt>달ˉ아ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>看<rt>콸</rt></ruby> <ruby>䆀<rt>빼ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>䆀<rt>빼ˋ</rt></ruby>’에, 앟 <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>過<rt>고ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>愈<rt>뚜ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>看<rt>콸</rt></ruby> <ruby>愈<rt>뚜ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>古錐<rt>거ˆ쥐ˆ</rt></ruby>’랗&#8221;)\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    (“tā̰-â-khoa̰ bâi-bài’e, ah m-kò-rû-khoa̰ rû-kôr-jûi’lah”)\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<table class=\"wp-block-table alignleft\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;border: none;font-size: 14px\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td style=\"border: none;vertical-align: top;min-width: 5em;padding-right: 1.5em;padding-left: 0;padding-top: 0;padding-bottom: 0\">\n  <a href=\"#_ftnref1\" id=\"_ftn1\">¹</a>\n  <i>\n    <span style=\"display: inline-flex\">\n      <ruby>시<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>아<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>껳\n    </span>\n  </i> :\n</td>\n    <td style=\"border: none;padding: 0\">\n      (中) 潤飾（日文：<ruby>仕上げ<rt>しあ</rt></ruby> shiage）。<br>\n      (en) Touched-up (Japanese: <ruby>仕上げ<rt>しあ</rt></ruby> shiage).\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<div style=\"clear: both;margin-bottom: 1em\"></div>\n"
}
